      "text": "4. 🔄 Les Boucles (for & while)",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "index": "aD",
      "frameId": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. 🔄 Les Boucles (for & while)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.5555555555555556
    },
    {
      "id": "b4-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1400,
      "y": 990,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 503,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1698554136,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788790391928,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Pour répéter des instructions facilement.\n\n• BOUCLE FOR : Quand on connaît la collection/le nombre.\n  fruits = ['pomme', 'banane', 'orange']\n  for f in fruits:\n      print(f'Miam : {f}')\n\n  for i in range(3): # Affiche 0, 1, 2\n      print(i)\n\n• BOUCLE WHILE : Répète TANT QU'UNE condition est VRAIE.\n  vies = 3\n  while vies > 0:\n      print('En vie !')\n      vies -= 1",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12,
      "index": "aE",
      "frameId": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Pour répéter des instructions facilement.\n\n• BOUCLE FOR : Quand on connaît la collection/le nombre.\n  fruits = ['pomme', 'banane', 'orange']\n  for f in fruits:\n      print(f'Miam : {f}')\n\n  for i in range(3): # Affiche 0, 1, 2\n      print(i)\n\n• BOUCLE WHILE : Répète TANT QU'UNE condition est VRAIE.\n  vies = 3\n  while vies > 0:\n      print('En vie !')\n      vies -= 1",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2857142857142858
    },
