      "text": "5. 🔀 Structures Conditionnelles",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "index": "aG",
      "frameId": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5. 🔀 Structures Conditionnelles",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.5555555555555556
    },
    {
      "id": "b5-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 990,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 603,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 916885352,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788790391928,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Pour prendre des décisions selon des conditions booléennes.\n\n• if / elif / else :\n  note = 15\n\n  if note >= 16:\n      print('Très bien !')\n  elif note >= 10:\n      print('Admis !')\n  else:\n      print('À rattraper...')\n\n• Opérateurs : == (égal), != (différent), >, <, and, or, not",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12,
      "index": "aH",
      "frameId": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Pour prendre des décisions selon des conditions booléennes.\n\n• if / elif / else :\n  note = 15\n\n  if note >= 16:\n      print('Très bien !')\n  elif note >= 10:\n      print('Admis !')\n  else:\n      print('À rattraper...')\n\n• Opérateurs : == (égal), != (différent), >, <, and, or, not",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4835164835164836
    },
